*Baseline.* Git revision `836eec2` of `ndt`, including subsequent MVVM, Task planning and integrated DM and radio planning workflow changes through 13 November 2026. The document describes the implementation. A bounded local drive-test job queue and uncalibrated planning-power engine are implemented. Authentication, calibrated RF/mobility/service simulation and multi-user planning-edit conflict resolution are unavailable; DM analysis profiles and experiment submissions have their own conflict/idempotency checks.

